  m_text: "<color=#4CC7FA>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> Same calls in C#: LevelComponent.AddXp,
    ProgressionManager.TryAddXp, QuestManager.AcceptQuest, RpgCharacter.Damage /
    Heal; bridge.Execute() from code.\n<color=#4CC7FA>\xBB</color>  <b>Scene workflow:</b>
    Select a bridge (for example 'Level System/Bridge_AddXp'): action type and amount
    are Inspector fields; buttons call Execute(), result events write the labels.\n<color=#4CC7FA>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Play: +XP raises the level, Accept then Complete finishes
    the quest, Take dmg lowers the HP bar.\n<color=#4CC7FA>\xBB</color>  Button.onClick
    -> *NoCodeAction.Execute()\n<color=#4CC7FA>\xBB</color>  OnResultMessage / OnSuccess
    -> result label and log\n<color=#4CC7FA>\xBB</color>  NoCodeFormattedText / SetProgress
    -> module values"
